      "text": "Days 4–5. Pantanal"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "a4ad8ff3ed7476a980ea8a6909c7e08de6fe162bcd4ff0a430fdadfb9dee2488",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-63081f33d4c840e99362579a12d8b39a",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, go horse riding through the valleys of the Pantanal. Along the way, you may see birds and other wildlife, including crocodiles in the rivers along the route.\n\nLunch is at the farm, with time afterwards to watch and photograph wildlife. Return to the hotel in the evening. Dinner is included.\n\nActivities on these days depend on the weather. Piranha fishing in nearby waters may be offered instead of the ride or in addition to it. You’ll wade into waist-deep water and fish with a guide. For more adventurous guests, swimming in the river with crocodiles may also be an option.\n\nLunch and dinner are served at the hotel. An evening canoe trip may be available."
    },
